# BUGS

No mapping of files, no `MAP_FIXED`, and no executable memory: under W^X it comes only from a JIT reservation (vmar(2)).
`<sys/mman.h>` is C's only: Swift reaches these by declaring them, since the libc's module map doesn't list it.
